            ],
            "logprobs": [],
            "text": "**ISPH—the International School @ ParkCity Hanoi—has published its 2026 results**, reporting a **100% pass rate at both IGCSE and A Level**. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/%F0%9D%97%9C%F0%9D%97%9A%F0%9D%97%96%F0%9D%97%A6%F0%9D%97%98-%F0%9D%9F%AE%F0%9D%9F%AC%F0%9D%9F%AE%F0%9D%9F%B2-%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A1%F0%9D%97%A2%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%9B%F0%9D%97%98%F0%9D%97%A5/))\n\n### Latest results: 2026\n\n| Qualification | A*–A | A*–B | A*–C | Reported pass rate |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| **IGCSE** | 45% | 68% | 89% | 100% |\n| **A Level** | 69%* | Not stated | Not stated | 100% |\n\nSources: ISPH’s official 2026 results announcements. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/%F0%9D%97%9C%F0%9D%97%9A%F0%9D%97%96%F0%9D%97%A6%F0%9D%97%98-%F0%9D%9F%AE%F0%9D%9F%AC%F0%9D%9F%AE%F0%9D%9F%B2-%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A1%F0%9D%97%A2%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%9B%F0%9D%97%98%F0%9D%97%A5/))\n\n*The A Level announcement specifically says “69% of students receiving A*-A grades”; the IGCSE figures describe the proportion of grades. That distinction matters when comparing results. The 2026 A Level announcement does not provide A*–B or A*–C percentages.* ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/%F0%9D%9F%AD%F0%9D%9F%AC%F0%9D%9F%AC-%F0%9D%97%94-%F0%9D%97%9F%F0%9D%97%98%F0%9D%97%A9%F0%9D%97%98%F0%9D%97%9F-%F0%9D%97%A3%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A6%F0%9D%97%A6-%F0%9D%97%A5%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A7/))\n\n### Previous year: 2025\n\n| Qualification | A*–A grades | A*–B grades | A*–C grades | Pass rate |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| **IGCSE** | 48% | 70% | 92% | 100% |\n| **A Level** | 68% | 93% | 100% | 100% |\n\nSources: ISPH’s official 2025 IGCSE and A Level announcements. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/isph-students-receive-outstanding-results/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**For context:** 2025 was ISPH’s first A Level graduating cohort, and 2026 its second. The announcements do not state cohort sizes, so I would ask the school for student numbers and subject-by-subject results before making direct comparisons with other schools. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/congratulation-class-of-2025-on-world-class-a-level-success/))"
